              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo nibo ba baaba be luuya lwa Merari nibo Musa ne Aruni babala khuloondekhana ne lilaka lia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.",
          "type": "text",
